# Used automatically by `vite build` (production builds only — dev still defaults to
# localhost:5000/api via services/api.js). This is a public URL, not a secret, so it's
# safe to commit — unlike backend/.env.
#
# Points at the Railway service rebuilt on 2026-08-24 after the previous Railway account
# expired. Vite inlines this at BUILD time, so changing it requires a fresh frontend
# deploy — an already-built bundle will keep calling whatever was set when it was built.
#
# NOTE: if VITE_API_URL is also set as an Environment Variable in the Vercel project
# dashboard, that value wins and this file is ignored. Keep the two in step, or an old
# URL will keep shipping from a deploy that looks correct here.
VITE_API_URL=https://interviewerai-production-b311.up.railway.app/api
